Jack the Ripper was a lady killer in the  worst sense of the word so it only makes  sense that Evie Frye will get to hunt  down history's most notorious serial  killer Jack the Ripper DLC is cutting  its way into Assassin's Creed syndicate  on December 15 the DLC will be available  on ps4 xbox one and pc for Ubisoft's  latest Assassin's Creed title and it  takes place 20 years after the events of  the main game the description reads the  streets of London are filled with fear  and Evie fries on the trail of one of  history's most mysterious killers armed  with some new skills she must  investigate a series of crimes that draw  her deep into the dark underworld of  Victorian London's Whitechapel district  this Jack the Ripper mystery will cost  you 1499 a la carte but it's also  available as part of the game season  pass priced at twenty-nine ninety-nine  making that purchase will also net you  three additional gameplay packs two sets  of gear and weapons and a permanent XP  boost if you're looking for a reason to  return to London for more assassination  action this DLC pack seems like a good  excuse if you're looking for more  information on all upcoming Assassin's  Creed content keep it locked at gamespot  com
 

